  "name": "30th Celebration First Partner Special Illustration Holo Set Vol. 3",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A set sold in mainland China from 7 August 2026, the third of three 30th Celebration First Partner Special Illustration Holo Sets (30周年庆典 最初的伙伴特别插画闪卡套装 Vol.3). Each held one of nine special illustration holos at random, all printed in equal numbers, with an acrylic magnetic card display frame and a 5-card Chasing Glory pack. The nine are the first partners of three regions: Treecko, Torchic and Mudkip of Hoenn; Chespin, Fennekin and Froakie of Kalos; Sprigatito, Fuecoco and Quaxly of Paldea. Side by side, each region's three make one long picture, full of places and things from its games.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: 30th Celebration First Partner Special Illustration Holo Set Vol. 3 (17 July 2026)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/23056.html"
      }
    ]
  },
